    "collapsible-content": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible-row-1": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What's in the box?",
            "icon": "box",
            "row_content": "<p>Each order of Everyday Essentials Bundle consists of <\/p><ul><li>6-In-1 Sonic Electric Toothbrush<\/li><li>4x Toothbrush Heads<\/li><li>Teeth Whitening Powder (6 Months Supply)<\/li><li>Stainless Steel Tongue Scraper<\/li><li>Tongue Scraper Case<\/li><\/ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible-row-3": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "List of ingredients (Gels)",
            "icon": "leaf",
            "row_content": "<p>All products sold on Smile Therapy are:<strong> <\/strong><em><strong>100% Safe, Natural & Certified!<\/strong><\/em><\/p><p>Teeth Whitening Powder:<br\/>Calcium Carbonate, Cyclodextrin, Sodium Bicarbonate, Xylitol, Phtalimidoperoxycaproic Acid (PAP), Sodium Cocoyl Isethionate, Tetrasodium Pyrophosphate, Hydroxyapatite (nano), Mica (Ci77019), PVP, Phenoxyethanol, Mint Flavour (Aroma), Potassium Citrate, Sucralose, Menthol, Water, Monosodium Citrate, Ethylhexyglycerin<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "792a2454-8dbe-40ac-ae87-a745eb01fb9b": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Instructions & Tips",
            "icon": "clipboard",
            "row_content": "<p>1) Start by selecting your preferred mode on the electric toothbrush, applying toothpaste, and then gently dabbing it onto the teeth whitening powder.<\/p><p>2) Brush as usual, making sure to cover all four quadrants of your mouth. The toothbrush has a built-in 30-second timer to guide you.<\/p><p>3) Rinse your mouth with warm water, then use the Stainless Steel Tongue Scraper.<\/p><p>4) Extend the scraper wide, stick out your tongue, and carefully scrape off any white coating.<\/p><p>5) After 60 seconds, or once the coating is removed, rinse your mouth again, and you're ready to start your day with a fresh, bright smile.<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "22779142-8db6-4dbf-93b6-ac3fd9d5b799": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Warnings & Caution",
            "icon": "question_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Teeth Whitening Powder is not to be used while pregnant or breastfeeding.<br\/><br\/>Teeth Whitening Powder is not recommended for those under the age of 12.<br\/><br\/>If residue from the powder is swallowed in small quantities please do not worry<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_nbAPbH": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can the Teeth Whitening Kit be used on composite bonding, veneers or fillings?",
            "icon": "question_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes, the Teeth Whitening Kit is suitable for use on composite bonding, veneers, and fillings. While the kit is designed to safely whiten your natural teeth, it also helps to remove surface stains on dental restorations. The formula is gentle on all dental materials, ensuring that your composite bonding, veneers, and fillings remain intact while your smile is brightened.<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
